{"title":"2005 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many three-digit numbers are divisible by 13?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/2/de2eefa49d11e91a16da70e159b60413fbedc5bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 7\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 67\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 69\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 76\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 77$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"385\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> be any positive integer so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/e/d1ef18ebe55676d3288667a9b0d15c13114f9717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13k$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. For the smallest three-digit number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/953313bf90d7cc5829cc322ab71fba52b486601c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13k&gt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"79\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/8/f985a713d4b9a4126ae2cd71489ca58e8af9c5c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;\\frac{100}{13} \\approx 7.7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />. For the greatest three-digit number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/0/8e0685de65e15b26265a5444724c381dfebcecae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13k&lt;999$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"79\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/b/2cbf7bf445d1de289b2013108ce575fd88d98467.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&lt;\\frac{999}{13} \\approx 76.8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />. The number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> can range from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d5db6ea360f9b1367e4db85c18474906401e2c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$76$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/a/56a384f084010b278c3f37753c4c7a2d9941fea7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 69}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" /> three-digit numbers.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>3 digits number start from 100 and ends at 999.\n1 to 100 total multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/2/6a26321dfeb8fca161142c4e368e50ab6c9acdfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 =\\frac{100}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> \n</p><p>1 to 999 total multple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb3b65a12a2deacefdc24e999294b5eb5dac7f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 =\\frac{999}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> \n</p><p>Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/e/07ed7be81be61d1b92106f3c8b7a1cf30bae0620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{999}{13}-\\frac{100}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" />\n=76-7\n=69\n</p><p><br />\n~KENJAKURA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=393\">https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=393</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/101Rgutx1R0\">https://youtu.be/101Rgutx1R0</a> Soo, DRMS, NM\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8\" title=\"2005 AMC 8\">2005 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Foru